<title>UK: AMEC chosen to design, build Korean plant.</title>
<headline>AMEC chosen to design, build Korean plant.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMEC Plc's construction division has been chosen to design, build and manage a semi-conductor manufacturing plant for LG Semiconductor Co Ltd in South Wales.</p>
<p>AMEC will be part of a project team including LG Construction Co Ltd and other service partners. The project cost is seen at hundreds of millions of pounds, but it is unclear what size AMEC's own stake in the project will be worth. AMEC was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
